    "Name": "Eurypterid ERY-X009",
    "Details": "Realizing the X007 cost a lot more to produce than it is was worth on the battlefield, the RISC engineers instead came up with the X009. An Ultralight 415 fusion engine provides more maneuverability and a more standard Chameleon LPS replaces the Micro-Alloyed Ferro-Fibrous Armor. Two MML-20 launchers and two Heavy PPCs provide the main firepower of the design, with a Silverbullet Gauss and a Large X-Pulse laser available as needed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Reinforced Structure</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.49</color></b>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_eurypterid"
